        <mxCell id="b_15" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#1E3A8A' style='font-size:14px'&gt;1. Độ trung thực tiêu đề kép&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#334155' style='font-size:13px'&gt;RapidFuzz WRatio + SBERT e(·) [384-d]&lt;br/&gt;all-MiniLM-L6-v2 / Đa ngữ ONNX&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Điểm = max(mờ, ngữ nghĩa)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=42;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
