        <mxCell id="b_17" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#065F46' style='font-size:14px'&gt;2. Đối chiếu tác giả 1-1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#334155' style='font-size:13px'&gt;Khớp họ hai phía 1-1;&lt;br/&gt;dấu tiếng Việt (&lt;b&gt;Lê, Võ, Đỗ, Hồ, Lý&lt;/b&gt;),&lt;br/&gt;tiền tố (Van/De/Du) &amp;amp; et al.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=42;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
